1zzi|n|Act of stretching, or state of being stretched; reach; effort; struggle; strain; as, a stretch of the limbs; a stretch of the imagination. ; A continuous line or surface; a continuous space of time; as, grassy stretches of land. ; The extent to which anything may be stretched. ; The reach or extent of a vessel's progress on one tack; a tack or board. ; Course; direction; as, the stretch of seams of coal.	N:vy9,54,2~vy9,54,2
