2006|n|Strained; drawn close; tight; as, a strict embrace; a strict ligature. ; Tense; not relaxed; as, a strict fiber. ; Exact; accurate; precise; rigorously nice; as, to keep strict watch; to pay strict attention. ; Governed or governing by exact rules; observing exact rules; severe; rigorous; as, very strict in observing the Sabbath. ; Rigidly; interpreted; exactly limited; confined; restricted; as, to understand words in a strict sense. ; Upright, or straight and narrow; -- said of the shape of the plants or their flower clusters.	a:1gg0,63,2~1gg0,63,2	N:wup,43,1;1l7j,40,2~1l7j,40,2;wup,43,1
2006|a|Strained; drawn close; tight; as, a strict embrace; a strict ligature. ; Tense; not relaxed; as, a strict fiber. ; Exact; accurate; precise; rigorously nice; as, to keep strict watch; to pay strict attention. ; Governed or governing by exact rules; observing exact rules; severe; rigorous; as, very strict in observing the Sabbath. ; Rigidly; interpreted; exactly limited; confined; restricted; as, to understand words in a strict sense. ; Upright, or straight and narrow; -- said of the shape of the plants or their flower clusters.	j:12z,99,4;wuo,86,3;wup,71,7;iaw,69,5;1stb,67,12;1l7j,63,10;w8y,63,4;iud,54,3;1gxs,44,4;2447,28,9~1stb,67,12;1l7j,63,10;2447,28,9;wup,71,7;iaw,69,5;w8y,63,4;1gxs,44,4;12z,99,4;iud,54,3;wuo,86,3	e:1gg0,53,1;ri7,47,3;2911,45,34;16ri,32,5~2911,45,34;16ri,32,5;ri7,47,3;1gg0,53,1
