207x|n|Very dull; insensible; senseless; wanting in understanding; heavy; sluggish; in a state of stupor; -- said of persons. ; Resulting from, or evincing, stupidity; formed without skill or genius; dull; heavy; -- said of things.	n:1xo2,12,2~1xo2,12,2
207x|a|Very dull; insensible; senseless; wanting in understanding; heavy; sluggish; in a state of stupor; -- said of persons. ; Resulting from, or evincing, stupidity; formed without skill or genius; dull; heavy; -- said of things.	j:1b7h,67,4;206b,53,4;1owa,47,30;23p8,43,11;107k,35,4;23p6,34,4;1ovy,13,6~1owa,47,30;23p8,43,11;1ovy,13,6;23p6,34,4;206b,53,4;1b7h,67,4;107k,35,4	e:1poa,29,6;24gy,22,4~1poa,29,6;24gy,22,4
